---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom Branding at Scale: Elevating High-Volume Private Label Orders"
  description="How to add premium branding to your large-scale activewear wholesale orders to command higher retail prices."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Branding Strategy</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Custom Branding for <span class="text-accent italic">High-Volume Orders</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>9 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">On a $30,000 order, the product is 80% of the value—but the branding is 100% of the customer's perception. Here is how to do it right at scale.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. Heat-Transfer vs. Woven Labels</h2>
      <p>For high-performance activewear, heat-transfer neck labels are the gold standard because they eliminate "tag itch." When ordering 3,000+ pieces, we can integrate these seamlessly during the final production stage. This gives your stock items a bespoke, high-end feel for a fraction of the cost.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Specialized Hang Tags & Packaging</h2>
      <p>Premium retailers look for details. We offer custom-embossed hang tags and branded poly-bags for high-volume orders. On a $25k order, the unit cost of this premium packaging is often less than $0.15, but it can increase your perceived retail value by $5-10 per garment.</p>

      <div class="my-12 relative rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white">
        <img src="/images/migrated/third-party/hcc2d5570d1a94d4ea98d26ce3312893dj-2b46b82f20.webp" alt="Branding Options" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Strategic Logo Placement</h2>
      <p>For influencers and boutique brands, logo placement is a marketing tool. We utilize high-stretch silicone patches and reflective 3M prints that don't crack or peel. By using our tested stock silhouettes and adding your unique branding, you get the speed of wholesale with the identity of a custom-designed brand.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Define Your Brand Aesthetic</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Consult with our branding experts to design your custom label package.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Branding Guide</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
